# Rules / skills = prompts

`.mdc`, User Rules, `AGENTS.md`, and `SKILL.md` are injected context -- author as prompts.

| Discipline | Meaning |
|------------|---------|
| Accurate | Live paths/tools/ids; fix drift on sight |
| Precise | One concern; actionable MUST/MUSTNOT |
| Low-noise | Pointers over paste; mdc < 120 lines; delete duplicates; `alwaysApply` only if every turn needs it |
| Consistent | One SSOT per fact across rules / skills / AGENTS |
| Coherent | SKILL-GRAPH routing; constraints in rules, procedure in skills |
| Abbreviations | Clear English names; expand house labels on first use |
| Positive | Name the structure, then the per-item gate |

[prompt-writing-discipline](~/.cursor/skills/prompt-writing-discipline/SKILL.md). Cut before add; verify cited files exist.
